---
description: frontend protobuf generated clients under shared/gen/pb
alwaysApply: false
---
Use these rules when the frontend consumes generated protobuf/TypeScript clients. Pair with frontend-core (and monorepo architecture rules when protobuf lives in a monorepo).

### Layout

- Generated protobuf/TS clients live under `src/shared/gen/pb/` at the frontend package root (in a monorepo that is typically `frontend/src/shared/gen/pb/`).

```text
src/
└── shared/
    └── gen/
        └── pb/          # Generated protobuf/TS clients
```

### Rules

- Never hand-edit files under `src/shared/gen/pb/`.
- Regenerate from the project's protobuf sources (e.g. `buf generate` when using the monorepo `protobuf/` + buf workflow).
- Prefer a shared gen package consumed by all `apps/*` rather than copying generated clients into each app.
